const pickPlan=n=>{if(!n)return null;let k=String(n).toLowerCase().normalize('NFD').replace(/[̀-ͯ]/g,'').replace(/[^a-z]/g,'');k={carthago:'carthage',cnova:'novacarthago',saguntum:'sagonte',tarentum:'tarente',athenae:'athenes',roma:'rome',syracusae:'syracuse',siracusa:'syracuse',syrakousai:'syracuse',athenai:'athenes',athens:'athenes',athene:'athenes',athen:'athenes',taras:'tarente',tarentum:'tarente',taranto:'tarente',saguntum:'sagonte',sagunto:'sagonte',arse:'sagonte',carthagene:'novacarthago',carthagonova:'novacarthago',cartagena:'novacarthago',qarthadasht:'novacarthago'}[k]||k;if(PLANS[k])return Object.assign({key:k},scalePlan(PLANS[k]));const gp=genPlan(k);return gp?Object.assign({key:k},scalePlan(gp)):null};
